<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 7.81 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 7.81 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 7.81 percent on Sunday from 8.36 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded on the market in 16 reported transactions with a total value of 23.35 million dinars ($33 million).</p>
<p>($1=0.708 dinar)</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
